OL,3,AKatie Razzall: BBC closures make
OL,4,Abusiness sense, but far more savings
OL,5,Aare needed
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe BBC's announcement that it will
OL,8,Fclose three of its linear broadcast
OL,9,Fchannels - BBC Three, BBC Scotland and
OL,10,FRadio 4 Extra - makes sense
OL,11,Ffinancially.
OL,13,FBBC Three's most popular show on Monday
OL,14,Fnight was a repeat of an old episode of
OL,15,FTop Gear. Around 77,000 people tuned
OL,16,Fin.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
